msgid ""
"Upload the same charges report you receive from Layan (Excel). We compare "
"each phone number to sales anywhere in Recharge Desk (any supplier) for "
"the selected period, and highlight gaps against Layan charges."
msgstr ""
"ارفع كشف الخصومات من ليان. نطابق كل رقم مع المبيعات في النظام (أي مورد) "
